      <data key="d1">"ORGANIZATION" encompasses diverse functions across various fields:

1) Serving as a database central to bibliometric analysis, this entity supports researchers gragAnd academics by facilitating gragThe discovery of pertinent publications gragAnd fostering an understanding of academic trends.

